  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "11.0.0 Update ApexTree core to 2.0.0. Motion is now on by default (collapse, expand and data changes animate and are interruptible), the expand/collapse button is redesigned with the hidden-descendant count moved inside it, and collapsing caps how far the camera zooms in: set EnableAnimation false, ExpandCollapseButtonSize 14 with ExpandCollapseButtonBorderColor #BCBCBC, and MaxZoomNodeSpan 0 to restore the old look. Adds UpdateData (animated reconcile instead of a redraw), ExpandAll/CollapseAll/ExpandToDepth/ExpandSubtree/CollapseSubtree, Focus/ClearFocus/GetFocusedNodeId, SetActivePath/ClearActivePath/GetActivePath, ExpandCard/CollapseCard/ToggleCard/SetExpandedCards/GetExpandedCards, CenterOnNode, Direction.Radial and LayoutType (dendrogram), Motion, Focus, SemanticZoom, AutoNodeHeight, CardExpansion and EdgeFlow options, the CountBadge options, ExpandCollapseButtonSize/IconColor/HaloColor, ExternalLabel.CollisionStrategy, OrgNodeData Tags/Stats/Progress/Actions/Details, and DataNode.HasChildren. Fixes RebuildChart and Construct, which passed serialized JSON where the core expects an object and so threw instead of redrawing\n\n\t\t\t10.5.0 Update ApexTree core to 1.14.0. Add Theme, EnableSearch, EnableBreadcrumb, EnableExpandCollapseZoom, EnableZoomPan, EnableSelection (+ OnSelectionChange event), Locale (RTL/messages), PaddingX/Y, EdgeStyle, EdgeColorMode, node-level CardImagePosition, ExternalLabel, ExpandCollapseOnNodeClick, NodeShadow/Hover, the OrgNodeData org-card model, and the ResetPanZoomBaseAsync method\n\n\t\t\t10.2.0 Update ApexTree core to 1.9.0, add EnableAnimation, ViewPortWidth, ViewPortHeight, collapse badge options, expand/collapse button styling, A11yOptions, Zoom/ExportToSvg/Construct graph API methods, AdditionalOptions for forward-compatibility\n\n\t\t\t10.1.0 Update licensing model, update ApexTree to 1.7.0, add event handlers\n\n\t\t\t10.0.0 Add support for .NET 9 and .NET 10\n\n\t\t\t1.0.2 Fix exception for large datasets on serialization\n\t\t\t1.0.1 Fix issue where chart gets created twice and Add RebuildChart method\n\t\t\t1.0.0 Initial release",
